        "content": "## Option C — Self-Hosted LLM on SPCS GPU Pool (Optional)\nRuns Ollama (`ollama-service:11434`) on a Snowflake GPU compute pool (`GPU_NV_S`). Disabled by default so you can run without a GPU pool or keep your GPU pool suspended.",
